{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_slice_4", "label": "Slice 4 \u2014 Derive Less, and Let a Part Carry a Real Picture", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Slice 3's exit run measured that L2 is a lossless re-encode of a source blob that is never deleted, so half of all derivative storage duplicated data the system keeps anyway. Derivative storage drops roughly 93%."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_l0_only_at_ingest", "label": "Ingest Stores L0 Only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Reverses DATA.md 2.1, which weighed first-open latency against nothing and was written before 'must run on a modest workstation' was a stated constraint. The principle it leans on is the same document's own: a derivative that may be evicted and regenerated is a derivative that need not exist yet. The warning is accepted as the price \u2014 L0 is already there, so the viewer paints immediately and refines."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_auto_thumbnail_setting", "label": "library.auto_thumbnail", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Default on, because the alternative fails the product: 1,000 STLs into a library with rendering off is 1,000 blank cards, and a visual index whose cards are blank is not one. Off is for a large or low-powered library."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_derive_job_kind", "label": "derive Job Kind", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "One kind, not two. 'Render a thumbnail' and 'build L2' are the same procedure differing only in the last step, and the (revision_id, kind) upsert means the discriminator already is the derivative kind."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_job_payload_enum", "label": "JobPayload \u2014 the Column Is the Discriminator", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "An internally-tagged #[serde(tag = \"kind\")] enum was specified and is wrong: every job row written so far holds a bare {\"path\": ...} with no kind key, so on upgrade every pending job would become undeserialisable and the queue would stop draining. The column stays the discriminator and the payload carries only the variant's fields, so old and new rows are indistinguishable and no migration is needed."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_revision_scoped_payload", "label": "The Payload Names a Revision, Not a Part", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A part-scoped payload would make the handler resolve 'the latest revision' independently of the grid's LATERAL, and two resolutions that must agree is a bug waiting for a second revision: render revision B, show revision A's row."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_part_image_inline_webp", "label": "A User Image Is Bounded Inline WebP, Not a Blob", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A photograph is never re-derivable, which puts it in the Source class \u2014 but SourceStore needs WorkerRole and the worker is unreachable from the browser, while DerivativeStore is evicted freely, so user data there plants a data-loss bug inside the future 'clear render cache' action. The original upload is not retained, only the bounded re-encode; refusing to store something at the boundary and saying so is not implicit deletion."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_last_accessed_at", "label": "blob.last_accessed_at", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Every age-based storage feature depends on it, and a column that has never been populated is worth nothing at the moment you first want it."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_cold_tier_deferred", "label": "The Cold Compression Tier Is Deliberately Not Built", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Measured on 143 MB of real STL: zstd -19 costs 38x the compression CPU of -3 for four percentage points, because nearly all of the available win is already taken at ingest. The same measurement settles a UX question \u2014 decompression is level-independent and effectively free, so no 'decompressing...' affordance is needed."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_derivative_kind", "label": "DerivativeKind", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_trigger_routes_on_api", "label": "Every Trigger Route Is on Role::Api", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Necessity, not preference: Caddy proxies /api/* to api:8080 only, so a route mounted under Role::Worker is unreachable from the UI. Enqueueing is a database write, so a trigger route needs neither the kernel nor ingest_dir; the rendering still happens in the worker."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_slice_4", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3_lod_design_slice_3", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_slice_4", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_l0_only_at_ingest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_l0_only_at_ingest", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3_lod_design_vertex_clustering_ladder", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_l0_only_at_ingest", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3_lod_design_three_rungs_always", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_auto_thumbnail_setting", "target": "specs_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_design_library_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_derive_job_kind", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_table", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_derive_job_kind", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_job_payload_enum", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_derive_job_kind", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_revision_scoped_payload", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-4-derivatives-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_4_derivatives_design_job_payload_enum", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_job_handler_trait", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "